<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended April 11, compared with the April 4 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.37 vs 5.86</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.14 vs 5.17</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.69 vs 5.72</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.62 vs 5.60</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.70 vs 5.70</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.69 vs 5.68</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............7.12 vs 7.10</p>
</text>
